  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox\" style=\"width: 315px; border-spacing: 2px; text-align: left; font-size: 90%;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Second Mexican-American War\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Part of Mexican-American Wars\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 90%; border-bottom: 1px solid #aaa; line-height: 1.5em;\">Coming soon<br />Map of the War's Belligerents in 2090\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">\n<table class=\"infobox\" width=\"100%\" style=\"margin: 0; cellpadding: 0; padding: 0; border: 0;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Date\n</th>\n<td>June 22, 2090 - August 14, 2092\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Location\n</th>\n<td>Southern Mexico, Central America, Argentina and Chile.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Causes\n</th>\n<td>Mexican annexation of Central America, U.S. Deportation program.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Result\n</th>\n<td>Status quo ante bellum;\n<ul><li>Military stalemate</li>\n<li>Beginning of the <a href=\"/wiki/Mexican-American_Cold_War\" title=\"Mexican-American Cold War\">Mexican-American Cold War</a></li>\n<li>Independence of Patagonia and Mapuche.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding-right: 1em;\">Territorial<br />changes\n</th>\n<td>Panama is occupied by the US, the rest of Central America remains with Mexico.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Belligerents\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/US_flag_63stars.png/revision/latest?cb=20150826055344\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"US flag 63stars\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/US_flag_63stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150826055344\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"US flag 63stars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_63stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"United States\">United States</a><br />\n</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20151031154418\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Mexico (2074)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20151031154418\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Mexico (2074).png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mexico\" title=\"Mexico\">Mexico</a><b><br /></b>\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/8f/Flag_of_Argentina.png/revision/latest?cb=20150826013232\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Argentina\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/8/8f/Flag_of_Argentina.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150826013232\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Argentina.png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Argentina.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Argentina\" title=\"Argentina\">Argentina</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Commanders\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/US_flag_63stars.png/revision/latest?cb=20150826055344\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"US flag 63stars\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"US flag 63stars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_63stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/US_flag_63stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150826055344\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rayleen_Malakar\" title=\"Rayleen Malakar\">Rayleen Malakar</a><br />\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/US_flag_63stars.png/revision/latest?cb=20150826055344\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"US flag 63stars\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"US flag 63stars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_63stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/US_flag_63stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150826055344\" /></a></span> Derek Fabian<br />\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/US_flag_63stars.png/revision/latest?cb=20150826055344\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"US flag 63stars\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"US flag 63stars.png\" data-image-key=\"US_flag_63stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/0/0e/US_flag_63stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20150826055344\" /></a></span> Lana Obi<br />\n</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\"><b><span title=\"\" class=\"fakelinks\" style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #002bb8;\"></span></b>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20151031154418\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Mexico (2074)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Mexico (2074).png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20151031154418\" /></a></span> <span class=\"new\" title=\"Filipe Peña (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvRmlsaXBlX1BlJUMzJUIxYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Filipe Peña</span><br />\n<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20151031154418\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Flag of Mexico (2074)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Flag of Mexico (2074).png\" data-image-key=\"Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/2/25/Flag_of_Mexico_%282074%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20151031154418\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luis_Zepeda\" title=\"Luis Zepeda\">Luis Zepeda</a>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Strength\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\">\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\">173700\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #B0C4DE; text-align: center; vertical-align: middle;\">Casualties and losses\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"border-right: 1px dotted #aaa;\">4000\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" style=\"padding-left: 0.25em;\">3300\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n</tbody></table>\n<p><br />\nThe <b>Second Mexican-American War</b>, also known as the <b>Patagonia War</b>, the <b>U.S.–Mexican War</b>, the <b>Latin War</b>, and the <b>\"War over Nothing,\"</b> was an armed conflict between the United States and Mexico from 2090 to 2092 in the wake of the 2089 Mexican Annexation of Central America, which the United States considered a direct threat to its interests.\n</p><p>Combat operations lasted for two years, from 2090 to 2092. American forces quickly occupied Panama, then staged a brief incursion into Southern Mexico; meanwhile, Mexican forces, while countering on all fronts, called on their allies in South America to their aid, expanding the War into Argentina, Mexico's most important ally of the war. With American attention split on two fronts, Mexico was able to push American forces back to Panama fighting the Americans to a stalemate by 2092.\n</p><p>The Treaty of Sao Paulo specified the major concessions by both powers to end the war: the United States agreed to recognize Mexican claims to Central America, drawing the Border at Panama, while Mexico recognized American interests in Panama and Ecuador. Additionally Argentina and Chile were forced to recognize the independence of Machupe and Patagonia, which were little more than American puppet states in the region to counter Mexico's growing influence. The war was officially a stalemate, but most agree that Mexico lost the least and won the most.\n</p><p>The one issue that both sides took great pains to avoid, but was ultimately the driving force behind both their actions, was the Great Deportation and the Southwestern Crisis. Mexico was fiercely opposed to the United State's deportation of millions of Mexicans from the American Southwest (mostly to Mars and the other colonies, though many made their way back to Mexico), while the United States considered Mexico's \"Ciudadano Expatriado\" policy a direct threat to its sovereignty. Both sides avoided conflict on their mutual border for fear of a larger and bloodier war over which side actually owned the Southwest, but that issue was only forestalled for the Third-Mexican American war in the 2130s.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Background\">Background</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSecond_Mexican-American_War%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Central_American_theater\">Central American theater</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSecond_Mexican-American_War%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"South_American_theater\">South American theater</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSecond_Mexican-American_War%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In an effort to divert Mexican allies from assisting Mexico in Central America, the CIA engineered a series of revolutions in Argentina through local proxies and with some support from Brazil, who wished to cripple their rival neighbor without direct engagement. For the last half century the US policy towards South America had been one designed to keep Brazil and Argentina in check by balancing them off of each other. This was a reversal of that policy. US forces dropped into Argentina to support Patagonia and Machupe's efforts towards independence, and disable Argentine and Chilean naval bases that could be used to support Mexico in the north.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261112165855\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.022 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 377/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7119/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 3519/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 7/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.435      1 Template:Infobox_Military_Conflict\n100.00%    6.435      1 -total\n 34.08%    2.193     12 Template:WPMILHIST_Infobox_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:821-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261112165855 and revision id 9764. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>",
